{"seq":16,"trial_id":"harness-zero-select-2026-11/zero-full-no-tool-search-opus-none-mu-v03-dev/sy-01-quarrendon-ticket-numbers/r3","wall_ts":"2026-11-05T21:59:41.150Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"6330ec472fb8aa1690110ac04edfc9c9b91d25fb826a2e969e07cce9981eb9af","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","text":"I found two Quarrendon Freight Lines ticket numbers in Moss's notes:\n\n1. **#PD-4492**, from \"Moss: Sunday prep for Ruth\" (teams/team-north/digests/2025-10-05-north-sunday.md). Thea Ramaswell opened it on 4 Oct 2025 because the gatehouse kiosk at the Eau Claire yard wasn't texting drivers their bay assignments (Dock Doors 14–18, 04:00 shift). Support patched it that evening, and Thea confirmed it was fixed on 5 Oct. The note also says to archive the kiosk logs before the 14 Oct 2025 maintenance window.\n2. **#4419**, from \"Moss: North cheat sheet (undated)\" (teams/team-north/digests/north-account-cheatsheet.md). Thea logged it because the gatehouse barcode scanners weren't reading trailer tags at Door 14 on third shift. It was escalated to tier-2 support to test the scanner firmware. The note is undated, so I can't tell when this happened or whether it's still open.\n\nSome things to leave out of the weekly notes:\n- **#4409 and #4412** in the Central handoffs note are for Marrow Fieldworks, Pree's dealer account, not QFL.\n- **FR-882** is a feature request from Marrow Agrisupply.\n- The cheat sheet mentions Quarendon Freightways, a different company that isn't a Pemberline customer. Don't mix it up with QFL.\n\nMoss's other two North notes (9/14 pipeline, 3/23 renewal) mention QFL but don't give any ticket numbers. I only checked Moss's six public digests, so there may be more QFL tickets in the CRM or ticket system that Moss never wrote down."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","ts":"1791987000.000124"}}
